    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Sub-section (1) of Section 8 of the Payment Devices Frauds Act, No. 30 of2006, I, Maithripala Sirisena, President of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do hereby appoint the followingpersons and the Institution to the Panel of Experts for the purposes of Sub-section (1) of Section 8 of the aforesaid Act.",
